# Isolated local stack scratch root (scripts/utilities/local-stack-up.mjs and any
# Wave-0-style isolated Supabase workdir). Holds a generated supabase/config.toml,
# a copy of the migration chain, a redirected CLI HOME and local-only .dev.vars.
# Untracked-but-unignored before this rule, so a stray `git add -A` could commit
# a whole local stack (including generated local credentials) into the repo.
.tmp/

